<title>USA: Clarcor Inc Q1 March 1 full results.</title>
<headline>Clarcor Inc Q1 March 1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>  For periods ended March 1, and March 2,  1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net sales				    $86,958	   $81,014</p>
<p> Cost of sales				 62,450	    57,913</p>
<p>  Gross profit				24,508	    23,101</p>
<p> Selling and administrative expenses   17,166	    16,167</p>
<p> Merger related expenses		    2,972		  --</p>
<p>   Operating profit			   4,370	     6,934</p>
<p> Other income (expense)		     1,257	   (1,051)</p>
<p>   Earnings before income taxes	   5,627	     5,883</p>
<p> Income taxes				   2,610	     2,131</p>
<p> Net earnings				   3,017	     3,752</p>
<p> Net earnings per common share	     0.19		0.24</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	  15,973,537	15,912,669</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 includes one-time charge of $3 million on United Air Specialists merger and one-time pretax gain of $1.7 million from sale of shares in G.U.D. Holdings Ltd. All amounts reflect February 1997 merger of Clarcor and United Air, accounted for as pooling of interests.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
